### Tes 1: GET semua data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/umkm

### Tes 2: POST tambah data (valid)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/umkm
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

nama_umkm=Kopi Nusantara&pemilik=Radit&alamat=Sampit&kategori=Minuman&kontak=08123456789

### Tes 3: POST gagal (nama kosong)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/umkm
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

nama_umkm=&pemilik=Radit

### Tambah data 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/umkm
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

nama_umkm=Sasirangan Banjar&pemilik=Radit&alamat=Banjarmasin&kategori=Fashion&kontak=08111111111

### Tambah data 3
POST http://localhost:8080/api/umkm
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

nama_umkm=Keripik Pisang&pemilik=Radit&alamat=Sampit&kategori=Makanan&kontak=08222222222

### Tes 4: GET satu data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/umkm/1

### Tes 5: PUT ubah data
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/umkm/1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

nama_umkm=Kopi Nusantara Baru&pemilik=Radit&alamat=Sampit&kategori=Minuman&kontak=08123456789

### Tes 6: DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/umkm/1

### Tes 7: DELETE lagi (harus 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/umkm/1
